	<entry>
		<title>Un alloggio per l’Anima</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://192.168.178.46/in-italiano/spettri-del-passato-memorie-intramontabili.html"/>
		<published>2023-10-02T19:29:03+00:00</published>
		<updated>2023-10-02T19:29:03+00:00</updated>
		<id>http://192.168.178.46/in-italiano/spettri-del-passato-memorie-intramontabili.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Costruire luoghi non basta, se l’anima non trova uno spazio in cui sentirsi libera.</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;!--
